<section class="section-padding">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>The Ancient Vedic Journey</h2>
      <p>Handcrafted using the 3,000-year-old Bilona Method</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="journey-grid" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 40px;">
      <div class="journey-step" style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="https://worldsno1bestghee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/step1.jpg" alt="Source" style="border-radius: 50%; width: 200px; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; margin: 0 auto 20px; border: 4px solid var(--color-gold);">
        <h3>1. The Sacred Source</h3>
        <p>Forest-grazed Kapila cows on medicinal herbs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="journey-step" style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="https://worldsno1bestghee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/step2.jpg" alt="Boiling" style="border-radius: 50%; width: 200px; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; margin: 0 auto 20px; border: 4px solid var(--color-gold);">
        <h3>2. Wood-Fire Boiling</h3>
        <p>Raw organic A2 milk simmered in earthen pots.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="journey-step" style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="https://worldsno1bestghee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/step3.jpg" alt="Churning" style="border-radius: 50%; width: 200px; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; margin: 0 auto 20px; border: 4px solid var(--color-gold);">
        <h3>3. Bilona Churning</h3>
        <p>Curd hand-churned during Brahma Muhurta.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="journey-step" style="text-align: center;">
        <img src="https://worldsno1bestghee.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/step4.jpg" alt="Elixir" style="border-radius: 50%; width: 200px; height: 200px; object-fit: cover; margin: 0 auto 20px; border: 4px solid var(--color-gold);">
        <h3>4. The Golden Elixir</h3>
        <p>Slow-heated butter resulting in granular gold.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Bilona Journey",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Bilona Journey"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
